## Model card

- **Name:** Space Bunny Alpha
- **Short description:** Anonymous stealth-preview reasoning model on OpenRouter/OpenCode Zen — blazing-fast inference, coding+agentic focus, native multimodal input (text/image/video), adjustable reasoning effort, 1M context. Vendor undisclosed by design; zero-retention provider.
