- **Context window:** 1M total (up to 524K in / 524K out per OpenRouter top provider).
- **Modalities:** text/image/video in; text out; reasoning mandatory w/ effort levels; tool calls supported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-24):** $0 (free stealth preview).
- **Architecture:** undisclosed (anonymous MoE per marketing language only).

